message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Mampok Gatekeeper Example"
abstract: "A minimal, self-contained reference implementation of the Mampok auth_proxy_image contract: a mitmproxy-based sidecar that gates access to a tool container behind a JWT token/cookie exchange. Provided as a documented example to copy and adapt, not a dependency of Mampok itself."
